          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A fledgling television program has been suffering from poor audience approval, and the station that carries the show has informed its producers that they will have to rectify the situation or face inevitable cancellation.\n\nAn unorthodox plan is implemented: broadcast a contest pitting various superstars from differing realities in physical combat in order to increase ratings.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Un programa de televisión novato sufre una mala aceptación del público, y la cadena que lo emite ha informado a sus productores de que deberán corregir la situación o enfrentarse a una cancelación inevitable.\n\nSe pone en marcha un plan poco ortodoxo: emitir un concurso que enfrenta en combate físico a diversas superestrellas de realidades distintas, para aumentar los índices de audiencia.",
          "source": "claude",
